sequenceDiagram
    %% the contradiction check over engrams that are near each other
    participant sweep as Sweep
    participant index as Index
    participant nli as NLI model
    participant store as Findings
    sweep->>index: next engram pair
    activate sweep
    index-->>sweep: two engrams
    sweep->>+nli: premise and hypothesis
    nli-->>-sweep: contradiction 0.93
    opt above the threshold
        sweep->>store: keep the finding
    end
    deactivate sweep
    Note over sweep,store: a reflection reads the findings later
